  << /ActualText (For as long as I can remember Saturdays have been game days\056 No matter what house we\031re living in or what happened during the week before\054 my family always gathers around the TV to watch Texas Longhorns football every Fall weekend\056 \n\nThrough times of frequent change \050moving through eight houses over eighteen years\051 Texas Longhorns football has been a staple for my family\054 a source of pride\054 excitement\054 and love\056 )
